    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "This application for bail under Section 439 Cr.P.C. has been filed by the petitioner who has been arrested in connection with F.I.R. No.238/2023 registered at Police Station Banar, Jodhpur City East, for the offences under Sections 376(a)(b), 376(2)(n) of IPC and Sections 5(f)(i)(l)(m)/6 of POCSO Act.",
